  "goodToKnow": "Die Endung is a grammatical ending: Adjektivendungen, Verbendungen. Endings often show gender: -ung, -heit, -keit, -schaft and -ion are feminine; -chen, -lein and -ment usually neuter; -ling and -ismus masculine. That's why this very word is die Endung. In computing, die Dateiendung is a file extension like .pdf. Plural: die Endungen."
